- **SLURM Job**: `2893788`
- **CPUs allocated**: `16`
- **Dataset**: I464 2,000,000 paired-read benchmark dataset (`tmp/upx_bench/i464_2000000_*.fq.gz`)
- **Command**: `-t 12 --compression-level 1` (production) / `-t 12 --counts-only` (diagnostic)
- **Methodology**: 1 warm-up + 5 interleaved measured repetitions across 4 variants

